{
  "dashboard": {
    "id": null,
    "uid": "ni-rss-ingestion",
    "title": "RSS Ingestion Health (ni_*)",
    "tags": ["rss", "ingestion", "news-intelligence"],
    "timezone": "browser",
    "schemaVersion": 39,
    "version": 2,
    "refresh": "1m",
    "time": { "from": "now-24h", "to": "now" },
    "annotations": { "list": [] },
    "templating": { "list": [] },
    "panels": [
      {
        "id": 1,
        "title": "RSS feeds by domain",
        "type": "stat",
        "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "ni_rss_feeds",
            "legendFormat": "{{domain}} {{status}}",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": { "unit": "short" }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 2,
        "title": "Articles created (24h)",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "ni_articles_created{window=\"24h\"}",
            "legendFormat": "{{domain}}",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "short",
            "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "spanNulls": true }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 3,
        "title": "Collection / RSS automation runs (24h)",
        "type": "timeseries",
        "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "targets": [
          {
            "expr": "ni_automation_runs{window=\"24h\",phase=~\"collection.*|rss.*|.*feed.*\"}",
            "legendFormat": "{{phase}} {{outcome}}",
            "refId": "A"
          }
        ],
        "fieldConfig": {
          "defaults": {
            "unit": "short",
            "custom": { "drawStyle": "bars", "fillOpacity": 40, "spanNulls": true }
          }
        }
      },
      {
        "id": 4,
        "title": "Notes",
        "type": "text",
        "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
        "options": {
          "mode": "markdown",
          "content": "Aligned to live Homelab scrape `ni_*` from `GET /api/system_monitoring/prometheus`.\n\n**Retired orphan names** (advanced_monitoring, not on Homelab scrape): `rss_feeds_total`, `rss_feed_success_rate`, `articles_total`, `articles_filtered_total`, `articles_duplicates_total`, `rss_feed_response_time_seconds`, `processing_duration_seconds`, `system_health_score`, `errors_total`, `active_connections`.\n\nPer-feed success rates still belong on the in-app RSS Feeds page / Monitor activity — not this Prom path."
        }
      }
    ]
  }
}
